---
kind: lore
id: east.trainersAshTower
title: Ash Tower, floors 2-6 (the siege)
---

// Behind the ashTowerStairs gate (the spectralLens, from mid). The mediums
// come to the tower to mourn and have not been quite themselves since Team
// Eclipse moved in upstairs; the grunts and Admin Corvid hold floors 5 and 6.
// The top floor is the contract beat east.ashTower.

// ── the mediums, floors 2-4 ──────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="ashTowerMediumAgatha" who="ashTowerMediumAgatha" intro="Get... out... of... the... tower..." win="Oh! Where am I? Why is my hair like this?" lose="Leeeave... usss..." prize="560"/>

<entry id="eastAshTowerMediumAgathaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.ashTowerMediumAgatha" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(ashTowerMediumAgatha))">
  @ashTowerMediumAgatha: I came to light a candle for my old puffsong. Then everything went grey. Thank you, dear.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="ashTowerMediumHester" who="ashTowerMediumHester" intro="You can see them too? The shapes on the stairs? Then you can see ME!" win="The shapes are gone. Were they ever there?" lose="The shapes like me better." prize="560"/>

<entry id="eastAshTowerMediumHesterAfter" on="talk" target="npc.ashTowerMediumHester" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(ashTowerMediumHester))">
  @ashTowerMediumHester: The monsters resting here don't mind visitors. It's the living ones upstairs they can't abide.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="ashTowerMediumLorna" who="ashTowerMediumLorna" intro="Kekeke... kekeke... KEKEKE!" win="Kek... oh. Oh, how embarrassing." lose="Kekeke!" prize="600"/>

<entry id="eastAshTowerMediumLornaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.ashTowerMediumLorna" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(ashTowerMediumLorna))">
  @ashTowerMediumLorna: I have never said "kekeke" in my life. Please forget you heard it.
</entry>

// ── Team Eclipse, floors 5-6 ─────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="ashTowerGruntMoss" who="ashTowerGruntMoss" intro="How'd you get up the stairs? The ghost was supposed to scare off the tourists!" win="Ugh. I hate this job. I hate this tower." lose="Scram! Before the ghost comes back!" prize="700"/>

<entry id="eastAshTowerGruntMossAfter" on="talk" target="npc.ashTowerGruntMoss" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(ashTowerGruntMoss))">
  @ashTowerGruntMoss: The Director says the old man knows where the great sleepers are. I say the old man's been asleep since we got here.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="ashTowerGruntSlate" who="ashTowerGruntSlate" intro="Team Eclipse has this tower under new management! Visiting hours are over!" win="Management will hear about this." lose="Visiting hours, I said!" prize="700"/>

<entry id="eastAshTowerGruntSlateAfter" on="talk" target="npc.ashTowerGruntSlate" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(ashTowerGruntSlate))">
  @ashTowerGruntSlate: Admin Corvid's upstairs. If you're smart you'll go home. You're not smart, are you.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="ashTowerAdminCorvid" title="Admin Corvid" who="ashTowerAdminCorvid" intro="A child with a lens. The Director warned me about curious children. He did not say you would be this curious." win="Hm. The Director will want to hear about you, personally." lose="Run along. Tell your professor Team Eclipse sends its regards." prize="1600"/>

<entry id="eastAshTowerAdminCorvidAfter" on="talk" target="npc.ashTowerAdminCorvid" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(ashTowerAdminCorvid))">
  @ashTowerAdminCorvid: Do you know what sleeps under Verdane? No. Nor do we, yet. That is the only reason we are still here.
</entry>
